and implementation and configuration challenges, and, for some complex transactions, delayed revenue recognition, all of which could harm our business and operating results.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"8b82cf4c3f75b59c6d370e495c62562ea2effd1ba6f9a0cd1f36113e3f853342"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","quote":"As more of our sales efforts are targeted at larger enterprise customers, our sales cycle may become more time-consuming and expensive, we may encounter pricing pressure and implementation and configuration challenges, and we may have to delay revenue recognition for some complex transactions, all of which could harm our business and operating results.","source":"CRM-0001108524-25-000006","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"76b2dde556463bebf768ddb2826e3be0e9ad04bd799c485fa63a4d95f1e0d8d5"},"CRM.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk","quote":"Social, ethical, and regulatory issues, including the development, deployment, use or capabilities of AI in our offerings, may result in reputational harm, legal liability and increased compliance costs.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"ea760d9b619b6a41e721d2a40f7b501b4bebb302cbaa7833a311f06780ac464e"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Social and ethical issues, including the use or capabilities of AI in our offerings, may result in reputational harm and liability.","source":"CRM-0001108524-25-000006","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"a943a4b6e455b8815157f0973afac94f4ab5941f2c2203b0c7963005b1ace3a6"},"CRM.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk","quote":"Our stock price is likely to be volatile and could subject us to litigation.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"eb9a6ec1a3a07099dddf5fb3789cfb39dac1abf0244455c04db50f473421f339"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","