mpete in international markets and subject us to liability if we are not in full compliance with applicable laws.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"c8130db28b61b9be06643b6caae2a3f56798fa16a147665190c11713c5e131fd"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.5":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We are subject to governmental sanctions and export and import controls that could impair our ability to compete in international markets and may subject us to liability if we are not in full compliance with applicable laws.","source":"CRM-0001108524-25-000006","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"e9ee8fd59b0fb38807b08f37277204f1196034a0bfb5fc2d5f308074f32cd500"},"CRM.q.riskrw.6":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk","quote":"Privacy concerns and laws as well as evolving regulation of cloud computing, AI services, cross-border data transfers and other domestic or foreign regulations may limit the use and adoption of our services and adversely affect our business.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"dd104c623b83928fccd4d9e1740d429b821a0abf2d3c5997335cc1905fdcc9a4"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.6":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Privacy concerns and laws as well as evolving regulation of cloud computing, AI services, cross-border data transfer restrictions and other domestic or foreign regulations may limit the use and adoption of our services and adversely affect our business.","source":"CRM-0001108524-25-000006","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"cbc76a1c68fb564c3b5c15cce8a8ff95febc85a4c9fbe524e0a05003ad881f59"},"CRM.q.riskrw.7":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk","quote":"Geopolitical crises, natural disasters and other catastrophic events beyond our control have in the past and may in the future materially adversely affect us.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"2d5999d92c46242af98566b3761d86323b3a035e5c970c1c98bd87ab743b0c8a"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.7":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Geopolitical crises, natural disasters and other events beyond our control have in the past and may in the future materially adversely affect us.","source":"CRM-0001108524-25-000006","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"7637375174b09498e3e531fc6e1bd8adee45284d3664043b29e7197c0f47e1ae"},"CRM.q.riskrw.8":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk","quote":"If third-party developers and vendors do not continue to embrace our technology delivery model and enterprise cloud computing services, or if our customers seek warranties from us for third-party applications, integrations, data and content, our business could be harmed.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"9ef1c9ad297171771dcb81b0d404ad157062dfccbe2da984780ed4a1a090b153"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.8":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If third-party developers and providers do not continue to embrace our technology delivery model and enterprise cloud computing services, or if our customers seek warranties from us for third-party applications, integrations, data and content, our business could be harmed.","source":"CRM-0001108524-25-000006","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"cbc3589b36e1a54d4da5eecfcf1a8e0f621fefcb0eb7cc9d96f51e2edda75ad8"},"CRM.q.riskrw.9":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk","quote":"Any interruptions or delays in services from third parties, including data center hosting facilities, cloud computing platform providers and other hardware and software vendors, as well as Internet infrastructure, or from our inability to adequately plan for and manage service interruptions or infrastructure capacity requirements, could impair the delivery of our services and harm our business.","source":"CRM-0001108524-26-000060","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-02","proof":"76aa1a327a3adb667634fdf8d16a7271c96ffd55da44d99712c469c7e530133b"},"CRM.q.riskrwwas.9":{"c":"CRM","kind":"risk-was","quote":"